  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "CTD Profile Data by PMEL Vents Program (PMEL EPIC)",
  "description": "This one-dimensional data set was indexed by pressure or depth, specifically, and collected by CTD from the hydrothermal venting area in the mid-latitudes of the North Pacific Ocean. Depth range was 0 to 6047m deep. There are currently 972 files available for plotting and download. Data were collected by the PMEL Vents Program scientists and are available through PMEL EPIC website. [PMEL - Pacific Marine Environmental Laboratory (http://www.pmel.noaa.gov/), Vents Program (http://www.pmel.noaa.gov/vents)]\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To support oceanographic time series.",
